sf-extra-faction-v-name = Veilborn
sf-extra-faction-v-description = Crystalline growth network. Combat units near a powered Heartroot or Resonator take 20% less damage and recover 1% health per second; isolated units lose these benefits.
sf-extra-faction-u-name = The Unwritten
sf-extra-faction-u-description = Fragile echoes and decoys. Combat deaths leave short-lived memory remnants; Restoration consumes up to six to reconstruct temporary infantry. No recursive resurrection.
sf-extra-faction-o-name = The Outer Silence
sf-extra-faction-o-description = Short-range ambush and suppression. Hush Stalkers cloak between attacks; isolated combat units gain speed. Detection, screens and focus fire counter them.
sf-extra-faction-n-name = Nephilim Remnant
sf-extra-faction-n-description = Slow, expensive giants supported by vulnerable human attendants. Nearby attendants grant non-stacking protection and recovery; raid the support and economy.
